  "label": "User projected onto the woman in the red dress",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman in the red dress, as the meme uses her image as the central subject onto which the hateful, sexualized, and transphobic text is mapped. The text 'has orgasm' and 'shoots tranny fluid' is explicitly projected onto her visual form, creating a dehumanizing and degrading semiotic projection. The user, as the viewer, is implicitly positioned as the one who sees and interprets this projection, making the woman the focal point of the hate speech. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you' in the text, but the projection is onto the visual entity, which is the primary target of the hate speech.",
